# Lavos from the telepod at the Millennial Fair in New Game+ (the Dream Project ending route; ends mid-battle, before the
# ending): load the fair save (Crono and Marle), walk Leene Square to the telepods, Taban's Super Dimension Warp speech,
# examine the right telepod's Gate, then Lavos's outer shell fought with attacks, Crono's techs, a MegaElixir and Marle's
# Aura/Ice, the shell's defeat, walking the inner cavern (with dialogue) to the second chamber, and the inner Lavos and its
